<!--META-DATA
{
	tags: while, for, find, zeros, script,
}
-->

<statement>
<p>
	Write a function <pf>hw3s1_ttt_display</pf>.
</p>

<tabular valign="top" top="minor">
	<col width="12%"/>
	<col width="88%"/>
	<row>
		<cell>Details:</cell>
		<cell><p>Write a MATLAB script that displays a Tic-Tac-Toe board and allows a user to add X's and O's to the board with mouse clicks, using MATLAB's <pf>ginput</pf> command.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>THIS SCRIPT SHOULD NOT PLAY A FULL GAME OF TIC-TAC-TOE.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Use the MATLAB documentation to find the code needed to perform some of the tasks below.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Important variable descriptions in the template:</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell>
			<p>
				<ul>
					<li><pf>player</pf> - tracks the current player. <pf>player = 1</pf> means it is X's turn. <pf>player = -1</pf> means it is O's turn.</li>
					<li><pf>game_board</pf> - tracks the space each player has claimed. A value of <pf>1</pf> in this matrix indicates that X claimed that space, while a value of <pf>-1</pf> means O claimed it. A value of <pf>0</pf> means it has not been claimed by either player yet.</li>
				</ul>
			</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Download the template.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>For each line below, complete the specified tasks in the script file.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 5</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Replace the zeros with the values that set the "Position" of the figure to have a bottom left corner @ (x,y) = (100, 100), a width = 650 and a height = 600.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 7</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Replace the zeros with the values that will plot a vertical line between the points: (2,1) and (2,4).</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 8</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Replace the zeros with the values that will plot a vertical line between the points: (3,1) and (3,4).</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 9</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Replace the zeros with the values that will plot a horizontal line between the points: (1,2) and (4,2).</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 10</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Replace the zeros with the values that will plot a horizontal line between the points: (1,3) and (4,3).</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 11</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Replace the zeros with the values that will set the ranges of both the x and y-axis to 0 to 5.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 32</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Use</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>ginput</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>to get the x and y coordinates of the user's mouse click.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 34</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Complete the if-statement that checks that the user's mouse click is within the appropriate range.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 35-36</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Use the</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>floor</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>command to round the x and y coordinates of the mouse clicks to the nearest integer.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 38</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Complete the if-statement that checks</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>game_board</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>to see if that user clicked a space that was available.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 39</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Add the</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>player</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>value to the</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>game_board</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>variable.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 40</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Increase the number of</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>selected_spaces</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>by one.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Line 49</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>: Change the current</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>player</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>value to the opposite player.</p></cell>
	</row>
</tabular>

</statement>
